  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shark Demon’s envoy Sha Nan Jiang finds Fang Yuan waiting on a cloud and brings him into Yu Lu blessed land, where an Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance attack is already underway.",
      "chapters": [
        888
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shark_demon",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After entry, Fang Yuan’s plan is to reach Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance headquarters through Shark Demon’s recommendation.",
      "chapters": [
        889
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Song clan’s headquarters sit in Heavy Water blessed land, and Twin Polar Sea Strait is tied to Song Jia Dan.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-clan-and-zombie-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_song_clan",
        "loc_heavy_water_blessed_land",
        "loc_twin_polar_sea_strait",
        "char_song_jia_dan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 903 is titled Joining Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance. Fang Yuan asks Shark Demon to get him in, and Shark Demon promises a smooth entry.",
      "chapters": [
        903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-clan-and-zombie-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yellow Spring Sea Area holds Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance headquarters, and with Shark Demon’s guidance Fang Yuan becomes a Zombie Alliance member there.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-clan-and-zombie-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yellow_spring_sea_area"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He then negotiates with Song clan while already in the alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        907
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-clan-and-zombie-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 980 is titled Joining Lang Ya Sect. Lang Ya land spirit creates Lang Ya Sect and invites Fang Yuan as an external supreme elder.",
      "chapters": [
        980
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sect-founding-and-invitation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 985 is titled Fang Yuan’s Entry into Ascending Heaven Plain.",
      "chapters": [
        985
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-test-and-clan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ascending_heaven_plain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness brings him there as Wisdom Star to test wisdom path methods against Old Eccentric Tian Nan’s inheritance amid complex, shifting space path dao marks. Song clan, Cai clan, and Ruo Lai clan are the three super forces contesting ownership of Ascending Heaven Plain; Song Kun, Cai Xiong, and Ruo Lai Gui Yi stand as their representatives on the field.",
      "chapters": [
        986
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-test-and-clan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "inh_tian_nan_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that trip, the three clans collaborate against lone and demonic immortals who try to charge the plain.",
      "chapters": [
        988
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-test-and-clan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later returns to Star Form blessed land and places Luo Po Valley there.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-test-and-clan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 993 is titled Immortal Zombie Bo Qing Appears; Fang Yuan ties Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s song to Sword Immortal Bo Qing and Falling Heavenly River.",
      "chapters": [
        993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-test-and-clan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_zombie",
        "char_bo_qing",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal zombie Bo Qing awakens, leaves Falling Heavenly River, and attacks Heavenly Lotus Sect, while Fang Yuan works in Hu Immortal blessed land on a formation to refine Bo Qing’s sword path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bo-qing-awakening",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s soul later enters rank nine sovereign immortal fetus Gu. The Gu expands, forms a fetus through eighty-one changes, and births a new living body with rank six Gu Immortal aura.",
      "chapters": [
        1021
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sovereign-rebirth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1051 is titled Three Supreme True Inheritances. Lang Ya land spirit names three major foundations as three true inheritances available for trade against Fang Yuan’s three assets.",
      "chapters": [
        1051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-supreme-true-inheritances",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1052 is titled Listed on the Board, Heavenly Court’s Pursuit, which is the next arc’s opening seam after this range.",
      "chapters": [
        1052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-supreme-true-inheritances",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_heavenly_court_pursuit"
      ]
    }
  ],
